silm:instances_papers_01_orientation_chapters_14_kleisli_enrichment_pipeline_sections_02_enrichment_by_type_information_yoneda_hom_leg_1 a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "EnrichmentLegAboutVetRecordExample" .
silm:instances_papers_01_orientation_chapters_14_kleisli_enrichment_pipeline_sections_02_enrichment_by_type_information_yoneda_hom_leg_1 silm:hasExample "In 'EnrichmentLegAboutVetRecord', the typed legs of the Yoneda hom-profile are witnessed by concrete Mittens-domain arrows. For example, JoC §6.18: Hom(VetRecord77, Mittens) = {about} is the Set-enriched hom-object; the single element \"about\" is the typed arrow from the vet record to Mittens." .
